\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b>01/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>30/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>30/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<b> 06/12/2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / Other State : <b>600/-</b></li>\n<li>OBC / BC : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>400/-</b><b></b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Mode.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 148.205%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>RPSC School Lecturer Special Education Notification 2026 :&nbsp; </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/01/2027</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age <b>: 40 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per RPSC School Lecturer Special Education Recruitment 2025.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 148.205%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan <span style=\"color: #008000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">School Lecturer Special Education Recruitment 2026</span> : </span></b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 121 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16.8776%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.4254%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6969%; text-align: center;\"><strong>RPSC School Lecturer Special Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 16.8776%; text-align: center;\"><span id=\"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_GridExamDashboard_ctl06_lblExamName\"><span class=\"FilterExamName\">SCHOOL LECTURER (SPECIAL EDUCATION) – 2026</span></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.4254%; text-align: center;\">121</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6969%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree with Hindi/English/History/Political Science/Sociology/Music Passed from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li>B.ED. (Special Education) or B.ED. with two years Diploma in Special Education Recognized by the Rehabilitation Council of India (RCI).</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of Hindi written in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</li>\n<li>More Details &amp; Subject Wise Eligibility Read the Full Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 148.205%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 148.205%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.676%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"440\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 98.5292%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 148.205%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.676%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"440\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 98.5292%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b><a title=\"RPSC School Lecturer Post 2026\" href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a><b></b></h2>