"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Rajasthan RPSC School Lecturer Special Examination 2026 is scheduled to be conducted on <strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"206\">06 December 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>5. What is the Selection Procedure of the RPSC School Lecturer Special Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates are advised to <strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"376\">read the official notification</strong> for detailed information regarding the selection procedure, examination scheme, Syllabus, and other recruitment-related guidelines.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>6. How can I apply for RPSC School Lecturer Special Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_22099\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22099\" style=\"width: 1462px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22099\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201472%20955'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"RPSC School Lecturer Special Recruitment 2026\" width=\"1472\" height=\"955\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rpscschoolspecialjune26.png 1472w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rpscschoolspecialjune26-300x195.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/0